      {
        "id": "lighter-basic_attack-l_form_thundering_fist",
        "name": "L-Form Thundering Fist (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Press or hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nPerform up to five forward strikes, dealing Physical DMG and Fire DMG. During the 3rd hit of the /bBasic Attack//b, drag the stick/joystick, and repeatedly press or hold [BASIC] to unleash a series of melee follow-up attacks. Release the stick/joystick to follow up with the 4th hit of the /bBasic Attack//b.\n\nWhile performing the startup light punch in the 5th hit of the /bBasic Attack//b, drag the stick/joystick and repeatedly press or hold [BASIC] to keep alternating between the light punch and 4th hit of the /bBasic Attack//b. Release the stick/joystick to follow up with the subsequent jab combo.\n\nContinue repeatedly pressing or holding [BASIC] to extend the duration of the jab combo.\n\nWhen you stop pressing or holding [BASIC], or when the combo reaches its maximum duration, launches a /bFinishing Move//b forward. Lighter is invulnerable during the /bFinishing Move//b.\n\nDuring the 5th hit of the /bBasic Attack//b, Lighter takes 40% less DMG. While in the /bMorale Burst//b state, Anti-Interrupt Level is increased during the 5th hit of his /bBasic Attack//b, and the DMG reduction effect is increased to 80%.",
